# Tracker's Rise (CIPlay trackers_rise): the meadow round 0 4, the tower at -14 -12, the gully round 24 24 with Burr's
# cage and the satchel, the anchor box -6 -14, the llamas round -6 14, Ranger log 5 at 2 -4.
island Tracker's Rise
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Tracks
zone meadow
expect step 1
read Tracking guide
expect step 2
open Tower chest
wait 3
expect step 3
zone gully
expect step 4
use burrcage
expect story burr 1
expect hidden burrcage
expect step 5
open Ranger's satchel
wait 3
expect step 7
open Zipline anchor box
wait 3
expect step 8
catch Llama 1
expect step 9
read Ranger log 5
expect done
